@startuml
title Outbox message lifecycle
[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Dispatching : claim
Dispatching --> Delivered : provider accepts
Dispatching --> RetryWait : transient failure
RetryWait --> Dispatching : retry
Dispatching --> Suppressed : recipient no longer authorized
RetryWait --> Failed : retry policy exhausted (policy TBD)
Delivered --> [*]
Suppressed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
@enduml
